<BaseLayout section="goodwellness" title="About">
  <PageHeader title="About" description="Community-based rehabilitation, exercise, and wellness across the life span." />
  <section class="section"><div class="container-page center-reading">
    <section><h2>Overview</h2><p>Yonsei GOODWELLNESS Center is the world’s first community-based robot rehabilitation gym. It brings advanced rehabilitation robotics beyond the laboratory and hospital into everyday community care.</p><p>With continuing support and collaboration from Wonju City, the center connects rehabilitation, exercise, and wellness with practical clinical experience.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Rehabilitation across the life span</h2><p>The center serves children, adults, older adults, and people with disabilities, including people with neurological, musculoskeletal, and cardiopulmonary conditions. Rehabilitation, exercise, prevention, and caregiver education form part of its life-span approach.</p><ul class="center-audiences"><li>Children</li><li>Adults</li><li>Older adults</li></ul></section>
    <section><h2>Community participation</h2><p>In 2023, approximately 10,000 people annually received rehabilitation, exercise, and wellness services through the center.</p></section>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
